WEBVTT

00:05:10.526 --> 00:05:52.247
☆When it is cold, we do not feel like going outside to do some exercise. However, exercising in cold weather has benefits for us. When we move our bodies in cold weather, our hearts work harder than usual to send blood throughout our bodies. As a result, we can burn more calories and exercise longer. By training in cold conditions, we can also improve our performance in hot weather.
☆☆Question: What is one benefit of exercising in cold weather?
